# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py (the repo-side check that
# the demo's copies are still the plugin's), build-wasm.sh and the crosscheck;
# wasm/ holds the page's host glue and GL shim, which are compiled INTO
# knockout-core.wasm, and the build's input manifest. wrangler would otherwise
# upload them and serve them, which is neither useful nor anybody's business.
# fonts/ IS served, licences and manifest with the fonts.
tools/
wasm/
